<title>FRANCE: Serge Adda to head Canal Plus Africa channel.</title>
<headline>Serge Adda to head Canal Plus Africa channel.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>French pay television group Canal Plus said it appointed Serge Adda as chairman of Canal Plus Horizons, its French language African channel.</p>
<p>He replaces Catherine Tasca, who has resigned following her election as a deputy in the recent French parliamentary election, Canal Plus said in a statement.</p>
<p>Adda has been managing director of Canal Horizons since 1990. SLA</p>
